      "serialized_row_index": 29,
      "source_cells": [
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "黒い集団が、一斉に頭を垂れる。\nその整然とした様子に、僕は恐縮してしまう。"
      ],
      "speaker": "",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "voice": ""
    },
    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "c6d34edbf64bf4025a78ba86f362d15bb70d4c023c77c1c848366321de5284f1",
      "grid_index": 0,
      "grid_message_index_0based": 11,
      "header_row_index_0based": 0,
      "hold": false,
      "hold_placeholder": null,
